{
  "key": "pr-774",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "board: pin lane width (min-width:0) + multi-line card titles",
    "description": "Closes #773.

- `.lane { min-width: 0 }` — flex items' default `min-width:auto` resolved to the widest card's nowrap min-content and blew lanes past `--lane-w` (Review 1084px / Approved 1364px / Merged 1602px measured). Pinned: all lanes 290/301px, doc width = viewport.
- `.title` one-line ellipsis → 3-line clamp + `overflow-wrap:anywhere` (multi-line as requested; the drawer already used this pattern).
- `.lbl`/`.meta`: `overflow-wrap:anywhere` for unbreakable tokens.
- visual-check fixtures regenerated via `capture.sh` (deterministic fixture mode).

Verified live (playwright, new board code incl. flow.js): lane widths, 58 titles wrapping, no horizontal explosion, dark+light."
  }
}

