- `.lbl`/`.meta`: `overflow-wrap:anywhere` for unbreakable tokens.
- visual-check fixtures regenerated via `capture.sh` (deterministic fixture mode).

Verified live (playwright, new board code incl. flow.js): lane widths, 58 titles wrapping, no horizontal explosion, dark+light."
  }
}

